---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Experience from "../components/landing/Experience.astro";
import Contact from "../components/landing/Contact.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="Utkarsh Tripathi, AI engineer and founder of Craton Labs, working on RLHF, AI sandboxing, applied ML and AI optimisation.">
  <section class="border-b border-black/10">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 md:px-10 py-16 md:py-24 grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1.3fr_1fr]">
      <div>
        <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-orange">About</p>
        <h1 class="mt-5 text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight leading-[1.05]">
          I like models that work outside the notebook.
        </h1>
        <div class="mt-8 max-w-2xl space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-black/75">
          <p>
            I'm Utkarsh Tripathi, an AI engineer and the founder and CTO of Craton Labs
            (Manta Solutions Private Limited). I came to ML through rail engineering and data
            work, which means I care about what happens after training: whether a model fits
            the hardware, holds up on bad data and keeps working once it ships.
          </p>
          <p>
            At Habitat I put a YOLOv7 licence-plate system onto a low-power ARM board at 15+
            frames a second, for half the cost of the commercial systems it replaced. Before
            that I built condition-monitoring and failure-prediction analytics for Siemens
            rail projects, and later forecasting and data pipelines at RiskPe.
          </p>
          <p>
            Right now I'm going deep on three things: RLHF and post-training, sandboxed
            environments where agents can run code safely, and making large models cheaper
            and faster to serve. I publish the study plans I use for each on
            <a href="/learn/" class="font-semibold text-black underline decoration-black/30 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-orange">Learn</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="self-start border border-black/80 bg-[#fdfcfa] shadow-[8px_8px_0_0_rgba(45,45,45,0.85)]">
        <p class="border-b border-black/15 px-6 py-3 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-black/55">At a glance</p>
        <dl class="divide-y divide-black/10 text-[15px]">
          <div class="px-6 py-4"><dt class="text-black/55 text-sm">Now</dt><dd class="mt-1 font-semibold">Founder and CTO, Craton Labs</dd></div>
          <div class="px-6 py-4"><dt class="text-black/55 text-sm">Focus</dt><dd class="mt-1 font-semibold">RLHF, AI sandboxing, applied ML and deep learning, AI optimisation</dd></div>
          <div class="px-6 py-4"><dt class="text-black/55 text-sm">Based in</dt><dd class="mt-1 font-semibold">Bengaluru, India</dd></div>
        </dl>
        <div class="border-t border-black/10 px-6 py-4 flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-2 text-[15px]">
            <a href="mailto:utkarsh1999tripathi@gmail.com" class="font-semibold underline decoration-black/30 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-orange">Email</a>
            <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/utkarshtripathi7" class="font-semibold underline decoration-black/30 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-orange">LinkedIn</a>
            <a href="/cv/Utkarsh-Tripathi-Resume.pdf" class="font-semibold underline decoration-black/30 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-orange">Resume</a>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Experience showEducation={false} />


  <Contact />
</BaseLayout>
